ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair came in at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids, with November to December at 47%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 30% on the middle of the grids. Grid 15789 had its driest year in 1954, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
